// Readable form of MAPHEAD.SCN, made by `dws decompile --readable`. Every event below was compiled and proven equivalent to the
// original section (control-flow bisimulation, tools/dws/flowcmp.py); sections that cannot be an event stay in the port form.
// Text is by key (text/us/dialogue.json), never the game's own words.
import "../../core/engine.dws";
import "../names.dws";
maphead {
    section(1246) replace {    // section 1246
        engine.no_escape = false;
        partner_death_started = true;
        if (stat(22) == 0 && stat(6) == 0) {
            section_on_exit(73);
            call_digimon_routine(routine("sickness_death"));
            await narrator;
            return;
        }
        if (stat(22) == 0 && stat(6) != 0) {
            section_on_exit(73);
            call_digimon_routine(routine("sickness_death"));
            await narrator;
            return;
        }
        if (stat(13) <= 0) {
            section_on_exit(71);
            call_digimon_routine(routine("dying_a"));
            await narrator;
            return;
        }
        section_on_exit(72);
        call_digimon_routine(routine("battle_death"));
        await narrator;
    }
}
